        "excerpt": "PR: Support gRPC and gRPC-Web protocol in metrics [closed; labels kind/enhancement, area/middleware/metrics]\n### What does this PR do?\n\nAdd `grpc`, `grpcweb` as a protocol to metrics when incoming request is a gRPC or gRPC-Web request and use gRPC Code instead of HTTP Status for `code`.\n\n### Motivation\n\nTo enhance gRPC, gRPC-Web metrics.\n\nSupersedes #9415\n\n### More\n\n- ~~[ ] Added/updated tests~~\n- ~~[ ] Added/updated documentation~~\n\n### Additional Notes\n\nSample prometheus metrics\n```\ntraefik_router_request_duration_seconds_bucket{code=\"Unauthenticated\",method=\"POST\",protocol=\"grpc\",router=\"..…",
